---
import { artifacts } from '../data/artifacts';
---

<section id="artifacts" class="relative scroll-mt-32 border-y border-hairline bg-paper-soft/45 py-14 md:py-24">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="mb-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-7 md:mb-14 md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] md:gap-14">
      <p class="coord pt-1">01 / Source materials</p>
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-heading max-w-3xl text-3xl md:text-5xl">
          The proof is in the objects.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-copy mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base md:text-lg">
          The site gets more interesting when it stops explaining Alex in abstract terms and starts
          showing the artifacts: maps, credits, index work, records, trips, and builds that keep
          pointing to the same instinct.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dossier-panel overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.08fr_0.92fr]">
        <figure class="relative min-h-[28rem] border-b border-hairline md:border-b-0 md:border-r">
          <img
            src="/industrial-map.jpg"
            alt="Framed Industrial Map of Washington"
            class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(14,23,20,0.08),rgba(14,23,20,0.46))]"></div>
          <figcaption class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-5 text-paper-soft md:p-7">
            <p class="coord text-paper-soft/80">Origin object / Custer, WA</p>
            <h3 class="mt-3 max-w-xl font-sans text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-4xl">
              An old industrial map from a dairy-farm porch.
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper-soft/88 md:text-base">
              Industry, land, inheritance, and place in one object. This is the kind of overlooked
              source material the whole site should feel built from.
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="p-5 md:p-7">
          <p class="coord text-accent">Signature move</p>
          <h3 class="mt-4 font-sans text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
            Look past the surface. Find the system. Make it legible.
          </h3>
          <p class="section-copy mt-5 text-base md:text-lg">
            The artifacts are not random resume trivia. They are clues: backstage production,
            parcel boundaries, public-market structure, tax rules, index methodology, and AI tools
            all reward the same habit of attention.
          </p>

          <dl class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-5 border-t border-hairline pt-5">
            <div class="dossier-stat">
              <dt class="coord text-accent">Entertainment</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">
                production systems
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="dossier-stat">
              <dt class="coord text-accent">Geospatial</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">
                physical evidence
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="dossier-stat">
              <dt class="coord text-accent">Finance</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">
                after-tax structure
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="dossier-stat">
              <dt class="coord text-accent">AI</dt>
              <dd class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">
                tool layer
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 border-t border-hairline md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {artifacts.map((artifact) => (
          <a
            href={artifact.href}
            class="group min-h-[17rem] border-b border-hairline p-5 transition-colors hover:bg-paper-soft md:border-r md:p-6 lg:[&:nth-child(4n)]:border-r-0"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
              <div>
                <p class="coord text-accent">{artifact.label}</p>
                <p class="coord mt-2 text-signal">{artifact.lens}</p>
              </div>
              <span class="mono rounded-sm border border-hairline bg-paper-soft px-2 py-1 text-xs text-ink-muted transition-colors group-hover:border-accent group-hover:text-accent" aria-hidden="true">
                -&gt;
              </span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-9 font-sans text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-ink md:text-2xl">
              {artifact.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="section-copy mt-4 text-sm">
              {artifact.body}
            </p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
